msgid "``[\"127.0.0.0/8\", \"::1/128\"]``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations.rst:1604
msgid ""
"The networks that may read ``/__sibuna/health``, ``/__sibuna/ready`` and "
"``/__sibuna/metrics`` on the HTTP frontends. At most 64. An empty list "
