"1,024)। मॉड्यूल अधिकतम 4 MiB का है।"

#: ../../operations.rst:2352
msgid "``agent``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations.rst:2353
msgid ""
"A process of ours that listens on the Unix socket ``socket``. Each thread "
